🌟 Project Outcome
This project helped improve practical understanding of HR analytics reporting, employee trend analysis and workforce visualization using Power BI interactive dashboard techniques. 
It also strengthened dashboard design, KPI reporting and business data interpretation skills through HR-focused analytics reporting.
